<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.99 BLN - SEPT 5.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.99 BLN - SEPT 5.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Thursday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.99 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Sept 9		     10,900</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Sep		6,406</p>
<p> Average reserves to Sept 4			   9,122</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,988</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
